.562 Lo|b.03 -17.07 2.68 -2.77|r15.36 -2.68 2.77|l88.72 25 10|a.339 .612 .715|l-11.13 3.83 -10.59|l4.1 -2.68 1.66|l43.9 -2.68 1.66
