.688 Lo|b.16 -18.07 6.47 -1.15|r14.03 -6.47 1.15|l84.73 25 10|a.384 .625 .68|l-38.19 9.24 -13.41|l-24.04 -6.47 .69|l72.04 -6.47 .69
