.1 Sx|b.056 3 -42|r0 32|l80 -100|a.75 .25 .6|l40 -25|r0 40|r0 40
.15 Qi|b.034 -4 -5|r0 4|l85 -20|a.35 .05 -.94|l30 -25|r0 5|r0 5
.21 To|b.124 -8 38|r0 -28|l82 70|a-.9 -.1 -.35|l20 -40|r0 -36|r0 -36
.4 So|b.083 -6 28|r0 -20|l70 55|a-.75 -.35 -.5|l25 -35|r0 -26|r0 -26
